<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Begin the day with God, He’s waiting there for you.</l><l>Morning by morning come, His mercy is brand new.</l><l>Rise up! Don’t wait! You’ll miss the Son.</l><l>He has so much for you.</l><l>Enjoy your portion and your part</l><l>Until the Morning Star rises in your heart.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Begin the day with God, He needs His people to</l><l>Be those who love Him best! Get up with this in view.</l><l>Rise up! Don’t wait! You’ll miss the Son.</l><l>He needs some to watch and pray.</l><l>Spend time with Him and let Him in—</l><l>To your heart so He can have His way.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
